# Mobile dev workflow

- Do NOT run `flutter run` on every small change.
- The user runs `npm run dev` in `mobile/` once — it auto hot-reloads when `lib/` files change.
- After editing mobile Dart files, changes appear automatically; no need to restart Flutter.
- Backend must stay running: `cd backend && npm run dev`
